msgstr "快速剪切直接复制数据流：无损，几秒即可完成，但片段只能从关键帧开始。"

#. {0} and {2} are times, {1} seconds.
#: ui/tab.slint:1280
msgid "It will start at {0}, {1} s before your start, and end at {2}."
msgstr "它将从 {0} 开始（比你设的起点早 {1} 秒），在 {2} 结束。"

#. {0} and {1} are times.
#: ui/tab.slint:1282
msgid "It will start at {0} and end at {1}."
msgstr "它将从 {0} 开始，在 {1} 结束。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1283
msgid "It starts on the keyframe at or before your start."
msgstr "它将从你设的起点处或之前最近的关键帧开始。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1284
msgid "Its streams do not fit in MP4, so it is saved as MKV."
msgstr "其数据流无法放入 MP4，因此保存为 MKV。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1285
msgid "Pick Precise to start on the exact frame."
msgstr "要从精确的帧开始，请选择“精确”。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1286
msgid "Precise re-encodes from the exact frame, and can include video effects and subtitles."
msgstr "“精确”从精确的那一帧起重新编码，并可包含视频效果和字幕。"

#. {0} and {1} are times.
#: ui/tab.slint:1288
msgid "Precise re-encodes from the exact frame {0} to {1}, and can include video effects and subtitles."
msgstr "“精确”从 {0} 这一帧起重新编码到 {1}，并可包含视频效果和字幕。"

#. {0} seconds of media, {1} megabytes ("46" or "55–80"), {2} a time span ("2 s", "about 1–3 min").
#: ui/tab.slint:1293
msgid "Length {0} s · ≈ {1} MB · ≈ {2}"
msgstr "时长 {0} 秒 · 约 {1} MB · 约 {2}"

#. {0} seconds of media, {1} a time span ("2 s", "about 1–3 min").
#: ui/tab.slint:1295
msgid "Length {0} s · ≈ {1}"
msgstr "时长 {0} 秒 · 约 {1}"

#. {0} is a part number; {1} and {2} are what differs (a size, a codec, a frame rate) in that part and in part 1.
#: ui/tab.slint:1306
msgid "Fast: part {0} is {1}, part 1 is {2}"
msgstr "快速：第 {0} 段是 {1}，第 1 段是 {2}"

#: ui/tab.slint:1312
msgid "Switched to Precise: transitions need re-encoding."
msgstr "已切换为精确：过渡需要重新编码。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1313
msgid "Transitions: Precise only. Fast joins with cuts."
msgstr "过渡：仅限精确。快速模式直接切换拼接。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1316
msgid "Fast copies the streams: only when every part has the same codecs, size, frame rate and audio."
msgstr "快速直接复制流：仅当每一段的编码、尺寸、帧率和音频都相同时可用。"

#. {0} is a size in pixels (3840×1714), {1} frames per second.
#: ui/tab.slint:1320
msgid "Precise re-encodes every part to {0} · {1} fps like part 1: other sizes get black bars, audio is resampled to 48 kHz stereo. Quality: the Clip page's Advanced."
msgstr "精确会把每一段重新编码为与第 1 段相同的 {0} · {1} fps：尺寸不同的会加黑边，音频重采样为 48 kHz 立体声。质量：见“片段”页的“高级”。"

#: ui/tab.slint:1321
msgid "Precise re-encodes every part to the first part's size and frame rate: other sizes get black bars, audio is resampled to 48 kHz stereo. Quality: the Clip page's Advanced."
msgstr "精确会把每一段重新编码为第 1 段的尺寸和帧率：尺寸不同的会加黑边，音频重采样为 48 kHz 立体声。质量：见“片段”页的“高级”。"

#. {0} and {1} are part numbers: the transition from part 1 into part 2.
#: ui/tab.slint:1408
msgid "Transition {0} → {1}"
msgstr "过渡 {0} → {1}"

